  "pairing": "newsreader-libre-franklin",
  "typeCharacter": "Newsreader is quiet and literate, like a doctor who explains before she touches anything, set large in regular weight and sentence case (hero about 6.5vw, section heads about 3.5vw, tight leading). Libre Franklin carries everything practical (lists, hours, phone, address) at 17px regular with medium weight for small labels, never uppercase-tracked.",
  "composition": "Light mint-grey ground #F1F5F3 throughout, deep chair-green band for services. HERO: columns 1–7 hold the Newsreader headline over four lines, the lead in Libre Franklin across cols 1–5 and one solid green rectangular button with small radius. Columns 8–12 hold the waiting-room photo, tall and bled to the right and top edge, its top-left corner cut as a soft arch like a window. ROUTE STRIP: a full-width thin rule in #2E5443 with five small filled dots spaced across the 12 columns, under each a short Libre Franklin phrase: the address, the lift to the first floor, the waiting room, the conversation, the examination. The last dot is ringed in accent mint. SERVICES ('Kaj delamo'): full-width band #2E5443; heading in cols 1–4; cols 6–12 a two-column list of the eight offerings separated by hairline rules in #4F7563, with the implants note as one small sentence under 'Vsaditve'. A cropped treatment-room photo (img_01, chair and window to the hills) bleeds off the left edge in cols 1–4 below the heading. TEAM ('Kdo vas sprejme'): on the light ground, cols 1–6 img_03 cropped tight to the gloved hands, instruments and the tray, no face; cols 7–12 Newsreader name of dr. Urška Lebar, her specialty in prosthodontics, and two short lines: special care for fearful patients, children welcome from age 3. HOURS + CONTACT ('Ordinacijski čas', 'Naročanje'): cols 1–6 a week strip of five weekday cells on #FAFCFB with hairline borders; cols 7–12 the phone as a large Newsreader numeral in #2E5443, email beneath, address with a simple line schematic map of Gosposvetska cesta in #C9D6D0 lines and one green dot. Footer a single thin rule and small text.",
  "imagery": "Only the client's three photos. Waiting room (img_02) is the hero, arched top-left corner, green chairs and plant prominent. Treatment room (img_01) bleeds off the left in the green services band, cropped to chair, lamp and the window to the hills. img_03 is cropped to hands, gloves, instruments and the tray, excluding the face entirely. No drawn art beyond the route rule with its dots and the line map.",
  "signature": "The route strip: one thin green line with five dots that tells the fearful patient exactly what the first visit will be, from the street door to the conversation, ending on the examination, not a treatment.",
  "copy": {
    "headline": "Prvi obisk je le pogovor in pregled, brez posegov",
    "lead": "Zasebna zobna ambulanta v središču Maribora. Posebej smo pozorni na paciente, ki jih je strah zobozdravnika."
  },
  "imagePrompt": "One flat full-page screenshot of a desktop homepage, 1536×1024 px, no browser window, no device frame, no perspective. A calm, characterful website for a private dental practice in Maribor. Page ground is a light mint-grey #F1F5F3; text is deep green-black #1D2A24, muted text #4F6058, hairlines #C9D6D0. Headings in Newsreader, regular weight, sentence case, large and tightly leaded; all practical text in Libre Franklin. Nothing centred; strong left alignment on a 12-column grid. HERO (top ~560px): left 7 columns hold a very large Newsreader headline over four lines in #1D2A24, below it a short Libre Franklin lead in #4F6058 across 5 columns, and one solid rectangular button in #2E5443 with #EEF4F0 text and a small corner radius (not pill shaped). Small text navigation and name at the very top left, a phone number at top right in plain text. Right 5 columns: the attached waiting-room photograph (green upholstered chairs, peace lily, window, water carafe) cropped tall, bleeding off the top and right page edges, its top-left corner shaped as a soft rounded arch like a window. ROUTE STRIP below the hero: a full-width thin horizontal rule in #2E5443 with five small filled green dots evenly spaced, under each dot a short line of small Libre Franklin text; the last dot is ringed in mint #BFD9CF. SERVICES section: a full-width deep green band #2E5443; at left a Newsreader heading in #EEF4F0, and below it the attached treatment-room photograph (blue dental chair, lamp, window with view of green hills) cropped and bleeding off the left page edge; on the right 7 columns a two-column list of services in Libre Franklin #EEF4F0 separated by thin hairlines in #4F7563, one item with a small extra note line. Show the top of the next section beginning: on the light ground, left half the attached photo of the dentist at work cropped tightly to gloved hands, dental instruments and the instrument tray, with no face visible; right half a Newsreader name heading and two short Libre Franklin paragraphs. If space remains, a strip with a week of five hour cells in #FAFCFB with hairline borders, and a large Newsreader phone numeral in #2E5443 beside a simple line-drawn schematic street map in #C9D6D0 with one green dot. No gradients, no shadows, no icons, no emoji, no uppercase tracked labels, no numbered section labels, no cream or beige anywhere, no extra photos beyond the three attached."
}

